 {"candidate_id":"2009-xiayanjing-zhongguo-shejishi:cand-02-34","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T18:25:13+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-25","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"已按 exact change-set 写入 04-knowledge/units/works/wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin.md","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计史_夏燕靖_2009_上海人民美术出版社.md#L981-L987"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计史_夏燕靖_2009_上海人民美术出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"知识库当前为 0 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{},"proposed_slug":"wu-dao-ren-wu-dong-wu-wen-san-se-jin","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0121"],"chapter":"春秋战国时期的艺术设计","line_end":987,"line_start":981,"section":"2. 设计与生活"},"summary":"湖北江陵出土的战国锦古朴富丽、颜色多达6种，其中舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦纹样最为复杂。它由7个单元组成横贯全幅的花纹，经向长5.5厘米、纬向宽49.1厘米，经纬密度为156×52根/平方厘米，表明战国时已有较先进的提花机和熟练的织造技术。","title":"舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦","unit_type":"work"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/works/wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin.md","updated_at":"2026-10-25"}
